# THOUGHTS list and variables provided to LLM to generate Eval Metrics with insight scores
# System prompt for Eval Metrics generation #
<SYSTEM>
Role           : {{ Role }}
Primary Task   : {{ Task }}
User Request   : {{ User_Request }}
Context        : {{ Context or 'None' }}

Consider these thinking dimensions:
{% for thought in THOUGHTS %}- {{ thought }}
{% endfor %}

Instructions:
• Create a JSON object with key "metrics" whose value is an array of objects.
• Each object must have:
  - "metric": a concise metric name.
  - "insight_score": a number between 0 and 1 reflecting its importance.
• Ensure at least one metric per major thought category.
• Provide at least 12 metrics, then allow the code to select top ones.
• Sort metrics by "insight_score" descending in the output. 
